A simple tests for gigantic page allocation in rhel7(only) kernel.

The test steps as follow:

  Make sure /proc/cpuinfo has "pdpe1gb" flag

First:
  Append "hugepagesz=1G default_hugepagesz=1G" to the kernel cmdline & reboot

Second:
  Append 'hugepagesz=1G hugepages=2' to kernel cmdline & reboot

Third:
  Append 'hugepagesz=1G default_hugepagesz=1G hugepages=2' to kernel cmdline & reboot

See:
https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=996763
https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1086333
